    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the solution of the differential equation,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
